  "讲员区分理性异议与生活痛苦所引发的疑惑。": "The speaker distinguishes intellectual objections from doubts arising out of life's pain.",
  "怀疑本身不是神无法应对的事，关键在于把它带向哪里。": "Doubt is not beyond God's ability to address; the crucial question is where we take it.",
  "四、进入神面前，重新认识结局与安稳": "4. Enter God's presence and reconsider the outcome and your security",
