  "亚萨虽曾苦毒无知，神仍拉着他的手、引导他。": "Even when Asaph was bitter and lacked understanding, God held his hand and guided him.",
  "真正的安稳在于与耶稣的关系，而非环境是否平稳。": "True security lies in a relationship with Jesus, rather than in stable circumstances.",
  "五、从知道神良善，到以神同在为自己的福": "5. From knowing God's goodness to treasuring His presence",
