  "讲员邀请听众省察：自己的品格、言语和性情是在彰显神，还是塑造自己的形象。": "The speaker asks listeners whether their character, words, and temperament reflect God or serve their own image.",
  "六、把疑惑带给耶稣，让信心在真实处境中受塑造": "6. Bring doubts to Jesus and let faith grow in real life",
